@startuml
actor Maintainer
participant "Dependency preflight" as Preflight
participant "Package manifest" as Manifest
participant "Offline prefix" as Prefix
participant "CMake envelope" as Build
Maintainer -> Preflight: verify-toolchain
Preflight -> Manifest: parse expected versions and hashes
Preflight -> Prefix: probe tools headers libraries metadata
Preflight -> Build: emit readiness result
Build --> Maintainer: admitted or classified failure
@enduml
